    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100305/1011003050240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003050250,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "やっぱアタシ、これからも何か……\r\nきっと返したいって思うよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100305/1011003050250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………そうか\r\nはは、樹里らしいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003050260,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシがどれだけのものをみんなにあげられてるのか\r\nっていうのは、よくわかんないし",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100305/1011003050260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003050270,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "応援してもらって、もったいないくらいの言葉\r\nいっぱいかけてもらって……",
